# Markdown is written by hand, not formatted.
#
# Prettier pads every cell of a table to the width of its widest row. Several
# documents here carry paragraph-length cells, so it rewrites those tables
# into 400-character lines that no longer diff usefully and cannot be read in
# a terminal. It also reflows JSX inside `tsx` code fences, which breaks
# samples that are deliberately written to match the shape of a call site.
#
# The ignore is here as well as in the `format` globs so an editor with
# format-on-save does not undo the rule.
*.md
*.mdx
